1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
I want Linux
for Raspberry Pi robotics.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
But I love
the iOS look.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
So I reshaped Linux
into my own workspace.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
My tools. My files.
My way of working.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
I want it small,
and sized for my workspace.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,000
I speak Arabic.
So I made my desktop Arabic too.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
This is vAntah.
Up-to-code/vantah on GitHub.
